  "reflectionText": "The lord came back and reckoned with his servants. To the two who had traded: well done, good and faithful servant. Enter into the joy of your lord. To the one who had buried: take the talent. What does it take to take the one talent out of the ground and trade it, before the day comes when the lord comes back to reckon?",
